    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d788">

                <pb facs="0872" n="586" xml:id="pg586"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763/72112/2556</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in the
                        Netherlands</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Van Dyke</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-08T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 8, 1916, 4 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>323. Referring your despatch 472 of May 16, officially request clear statement
                    and definition of the relation of the Netherlands Government to the Oversea
                    Trust and cable reply if possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
